# sys-static-azelf-early (docs/research/story-cp5-19.md §12): Valor Cavern as CP12
# finds it, the guardian still captive. FLAG_HIDE_VALOR_CAVERN_AZELF is set from the new game (scripts_init_new_game)
# until Rowan's event in CP15, so Azelf's object (ValorCavern_Azelf, a level-50 legendary battle) is not there:
# its tile at (16, 14) is walked onto and A on the tile past it starts nothing; Saturn stands at (14, 19). The
# released Azelf is sys-static-lake-trio's (parts/lake-azelf).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_EMPOLEON 55 platinum:MOVE_SURF
set flag platinum:FLAG_LAKE_VALOR_EXPLODED true
set flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_VALOR_LAKEFRONT_CAMERAMEN true
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_VALOR_CAVERN 16 17 up
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_VALOR_CAVERN_AZELF true
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_AZELF false
+0 assert state objects.length 1
+0 assert state objects[localId=1].x 14
+0 assert state objects[localId=1].z 19
+0 press up
until position 16 14 600
+0 release up
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_VALOR_CAVERN 16 14
+0 press up
until position 16 13 600
+0 release up
until idle
+0 press down
+1 release down
until idle
+0 assert facing player down
+0 press a
+1 release a
+30 assert state battles []
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_AZELF false
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_VALOR_CAVERN_AZELF true
